5G_bg1.csv and 5G_bg2.csv hold the 5G NR LDPC base graph shift tables of
3GPP TS 38.212, Tables 5.3.2-2 (BG1) and 5.3.2-3 (BG2).

The files are copied unchanged from NVIDIA Sionna 2.2.0
(sionna/phy/fec/ldpc/codes/), which is
